*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info
.ruff_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.coverage.*

